---
import Marketing from '@/layouts/Marketing.astro';
import Button from '@/components/shared/Button.astro';
import { buildOrganizationSchema } from '@/lib/schema';
import { APP_NAME, SIGNUP_URL, AUTHOR_NAME, AUTHOR_URL, LEGAL_ENTITY, PRIMARY_CTA } from '@/constants';

const structuredData = [buildOrganizationSchema()];
---

<Marketing
  title={`About | ${APP_NAME}`}
  description={`${APP_NAME} is the open-source, approval-first AI SEO content engine. Why we built it, who it's for, and the editorial-approval principle behind it.`}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
  <section class="border-b border-line py-[88px]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-8">
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(34px,5vw,48px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink [text-wrap:balance]">
        The open-source, approval-first AI SEO content engine
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-2 [text-wrap:pretty]">
        {APP_NAME} produces SEO and AI-search content (product and collection copy, blog, and structured data) across every client's Shopify, WooCommerce or Magento store, from isolated per-client workspaces with white-label reporting. Its defining principle: <strong class="font-medium text-ink">nothing publishes to a client's brand unreviewed</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line py-[72px]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-8 flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
      <h2 class="mb-1 text-[clamp(24px,3.2vw,30px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Why we built it</h2>
      <p>For two years the AI-content pitch was volume: generate hundreds of articles, publish them automatically. Then Google's 2025 scaled-content-abuse enforcement changed the maths, unreviewed AI volume became a penalty risk, not a growth hack. For an agency, publishing unchecked AI to a <em>client's</em> brand was always the bigger risk: a hallucinated product spec, an off-brand voice, a claim no one signed off on.</p>
      <p>{APP_NAME} was built for anyone who can't take that risk. The stakes are sharpest for an agency publishing to a client's brand, but they are the same stakes on your own site. It keeps the speed of AI generation but adds the thing autopilot tools removed, <a href="/approval-first-seo-content" class="text-ink underline decoration-line decoration-1 underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-accent">a human editorial gate</a>, with the approver recorded on every article, before anything goes live.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 mb-1 text-[clamp(24px,3.2vw,30px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Who it's for</h2>
      <p>Agencies running SEO content across a roster of client sites, each in its own workspace, and anyone else who wants AI-assisted SEO content without handing over the publish button. The engine is open source, so you can run it on your own infrastructure, read the scoring, and change it.</p>

      <p>Agencies get a tier of their own: per-client workspaces, isolated voice profiles and white-label reporting, for firms running this across several brands at once. That is a plan, not the whole product.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 mb-1 text-[clamp(24px,3.2vw,30px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Who's behind it</h2>
      <p>{APP_NAME} is built and operated by <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">{LEGAL_ENTITY.name}</strong> (VAT {LEGAL_ENTITY.vat}), a company in {LEGAL_ENTITY.country}, and is part of <a href={LEGAL_ENTITY.parentUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline decoration-line decoration-1 underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-accent">{LEGAL_ENTITY.parentLabel}</a>. It was founded by <a href={AUTHOR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline decoration-line decoration-1 underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-accent">{AUTHOR_NAME}</a>. Follow the company on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/altorank" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline decoration-line decoration-1 underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-accent">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line py-[72px]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-[clamp(22px,3vw,28px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink [text-wrap:balance]">
        See approval-first content in your own workflow
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-7 mx-auto max-w-[520px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
        Run SEO and AI-search content across every client store, reviewed before it ships. Free to self-host, €69/mo managed.
      </p>
      <Button href={SIGNUP_URL}>
  {PRIMARY_CTA.label}
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m0 0-6-6m6 6-6 6" /></svg>
</Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Marketing>
